      <div type="clause" n="7">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVEg">IV Eg</ref> 7</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe æfter ænegum ceape ride, cyðe his neahgeburum ymbe hwæt he ride; ⁊ ðonne he ham cume, cyðe eác on hwæs gewitnysse he ðone ceap gebohte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And he who sets out to make any purchase shall inform his neighbours of the object of his journey; and when he comes home, he shall also declare who was present as witness when he bought the goods.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ se ðe æfter ænegum ceape ride, cyðe his nehgeburum ymbe hwæt he ride; ⁊ þonne he ham cume, cyðe eác, on hwæs gewitnysse he þone ceap gebohte.</ab>
      </div>
